# DRIFTLINE: stage 4, the open sea. All through it, whales breach out at
# sea and their waves roll in to break over a stretch of road (the first
# at x 80, 100 frames after it starts); a car under a breaking wave is
# lost, a car beside it is not. Dartfish zigzag down to the road and then
# chase the car along it; squirts scoot across and fire three shots back
# and down behind them; a shark leaps over the road and is worth 5,000.
game driftline
wait 12
press A
cheat stage 4
cheat nospawn
cheat pos 80
waituntil swells == 1 400
expect stage_t == 300
expect alive0 == 1
waituntil alive0 == 0 200
expect cause == 201
expect stage_t >= 399
expect stage_t <= 400
expect swell_breaking == 1
# the next one breaks at 220: a car well clear of it is fine
waituntil alive0 == 1 100
cheat pos 120
waituntil swells == 1 300
expect stage_t == 555
waituntil swell_breaking == 1 200
wait 10
expect alive0 == 1
expect deaths == 1
waituntil swells == 0 100
cheat god
# a dartfish: down to the road, then after the car
cheat pos 60
cheat foe 15 200 20 1
expect kind_ground_15 == 0
waituntil kind_ground_15 == 1 300
wait 60
expect kind_x_15 < 160
cheat clear
# a squirt: three shots back (it swims right, they go left) and down
cheat foe 16 -10 60 1
waituntil eshots == 3 60
expect es0_vx10 < 0
expect es0_vy10 > 0
cheat clear
# the shark, worth 5,000
cheat pos 160
hold UP 20
cheat meter 700
cheat foe 17 60 140 1
cheat hp 1
hold B
waituntil foes_17 == 0 300
release
expect score == 5000
